rooms_desc ({"This is a place of exquisite beauty and silence.  It is a small clearingin the thick forest full of the sights and smells of spring days.  Butthere are no sounds of spring.  No sounds at all.  No wind blows, nobirds sing.  The stillness is complete.  No tree branches sway, noleaves flutter.  You know something is seriously wrong when you realizethat where you just stepped, the deep green grass shattered.","This is a very peaceful place.  Soft blue light falls from the high ceilingwhich is also mostly a watery blue, but has some soft white streaksswirling accross it.  The walls are draped in flowing fabric in slightlyvarying shades of blue.  It ripples silently as the air moves about theroom.  A thick, comfortable white carpet covers the floor completely, andlots of blue cushions are in piles around the room.","This is a brand new, unfurnished room.  As soon as you see it, youstart imagining interesting ways to decorate it.. it could be anything,a cupboard, a conservatory, an orchard, heaven or hell..A small note in the corner says:  'help build/furnish'.","This is a brand new, unfurnished room.  As soon as you see it, youstart imagining interesting ways to decorate it.. it could be anything,a cupboard, a conservatory, an orchard, heaven or hell..A small note in the corner says:  'help build/furnish'.",0,0,0,0,0,0,})
